    # "CI pending" / **"CI success"** / a conflict
    # RESOLUTION ("mergeable=mergeable (was: conflicting)") are routine
    # context and stay ambient via the catch-all below.
    #
    # "CI success" was DROPPED from this predicate (Andrew, botchat
    # #2484/#2485: "the status changes can be ambient" / "except like,
    # failures obviously"). A green build needs no active response — the
    # merge decision rides on the operator's next pass, not on a blocking
    # gate. FAILURE stays actionable HERE, on the transition itself, so a
    # newly-red PR is actionable IMMEDIATELY; the separate `pr-ci-red`
